[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 1. **Determine the cost price of the sneakers:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    The salesman bought 48 sneakers for $576. Therefore, the cost price per pair of sneakers is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    \[
