[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 2. **Calculate the total revenue from selling the sneakers:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    - He sold 17 pairs at $20 each:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m      \[
