[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[ A = P \left(1 + \frac{r}{n}\right)^{nt} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Where:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m - \( A \) is the amount of money accumulated after n years, including interest.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m - \( P \) is the principal amount (the initial amount of money).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m - \( r \) is the annual interest rate (decimal).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m - \( n \) is the number of times that interest is compounded per year.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m - \( t \) is the time the money is invested for in years.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Given:
