[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 3. **Calculate the probability:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    The probability \(P\) of rolling a difference of 0 is the number of favorable outcomes divided by the total number of possible outcomes:
