[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Since there are 60 minutes in an hour, we convert the total minutes into hours:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[ \frac{1275 \text{ minutes/week}}{60 \text{ minutes/hour}} = 21.25 \text{ hours/week} \]
