[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 1. **Identify the total number of possible outcomes:**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    Each die has 6 faces, so when rolling two dice, the total number of possible outcomes is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    6 \times 6 = 36
