[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m **Step 1: Expected value of a single roll of a fair eight-sided die.**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m A fair eight-sided die has faces numbered from 1 to 8. The expected value \(E\) of a single roll is the average of all the possible outcomes. Therefore, we calculate:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m E = \frac{1 + 2 + 3 + 4 + 5 + 6 + 7 + 8}{8} = \frac{36}{8} = 4.5
