[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    \mathbf{a}^T \mathbf{a} = 1^2 + 7^2 = 1 + 49 = 50
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 3. **Calculate \(\mathbf{a} \mathbf{a}^T\):**
