[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 4. **Form the projection matrix \(P\):**
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m    \[
