[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Next, we substitute \(y = \frac{4x}{3}\) into the expression \(\frac{2x + y}{3x - 2y}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[\frac{2x + y}{3x - 2y} = \frac{2x + \frac{4x}{3}}{3x - 2 \left(\frac{4x}{3}\right)}.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m To simplify the numerator and the denominator, we first simplify the numerator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[2x + \frac{4x}{3} = \frac{6x}{3} + \frac{4x}{3} = \frac{10x}{3}.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Next, we simplify the denominator:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[3x - 2 \left(\frac{4x}{3}\right) = 3x - \frac{8x}{3} = \frac{9x}{3} - \frac{8x}{3} = \frac{x}{3}.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
