[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \frac{2x + 16}{2} = 3
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
