[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m assistant
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m [response] First, let's calculate the total revenue from the flash sale. The salesman sold 17 sneakers at $20 each, so the revenue from the flash sale is:
