[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Using the Pythagorean identity \(\cos^2 \theta + \sin^2 \theta = 1\), we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m x^2 = 1 - 2 \sin \theta \cos \theta
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Substituting the value of \(\sin \theta \cos \theta = \frac{21}{50}\) into the equation, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[
