[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Next, we need to determine how many minutes he spends on extra learning time each week. He spends \(\frac{1}{16}\) of his weekly minutes on Saturday and Sunday, so the total extra learning time per week is \(\frac{1}{16} \times 320 = 20\) minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Therefore, the total time John spends on extra learning each week is \(20\) minutes.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
