[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Next, we substitute \(y = \frac{4x}{3}\) into the expression \(\frac{2x + y}{3x - 2y}\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[\frac{2x + y}{3x - 2y} = \frac{2x + \frac{4x}{3}}{3x - 2 \left(\frac{4x}{3}\right)}.\]
