[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m So, \( 3^6 \) is the highest power of 3 that divides \( 15! \).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Next, we need to find the number of times 3 appears as a factor in \( 15! \). This is given by the sum of the integer divisions of 15 by each of the powers of 3 from 1 to 6:
