[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m First, we find the highest power of 3 that divides \( 15! \). This is done by summing the integer divisions of 15 by each of the powers of 3 from 1 to the largest power of 3 that is less than or equal to 15.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
