[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m This gives us two solutions: \(x = 0\) and \(x = \pm \sqrt{\frac{9}{2}} = \pm \frac{3\sqrt{2}}{2}\).
