[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m So the height of the plant two weeks ago is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[ h = \frac{452}{1.9215} \approx 230.0 \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Therefore, the height of the plant two weeks ago was \(\boxed{230.0}\) cm.
