[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m The velocity vector is:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \left( \frac{d}{dt} \left( 3 \sin \frac{t}{4} \right), \frac{d}{dt} \left( 3 \cos \frac{t}{4} \right) \right) = \left( 3 \cos \frac{t}{4} \cdot \frac{1}{4}, -3 \sin \frac{t}{4} \cdot \frac{1}{4} \right) = \left( \frac{3}{4} \cos \frac{t}{4}, -\frac{3}{4} \sin \frac{t}{4} \right)
