[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[ P = \frac{\mathbf{a} \mathbf{a}^T}{\mathbf{a}^T \mathbf{a}} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Here, \(\mathbf{a} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix}\). First, we calculate \(\mathbf{a} \mathbf{a}^T\):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
