[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m v = \sqrt{\left( \frac{3}{4} \cos \frac{t}{4} \right)^2 + \left( -\frac{3}{4} \sin \frac{t}{4} \right)^2} = \sqrt{\frac{9}{16} \cos^2 \frac{t}{4} + \frac{9}{16} \sin^2 \frac{t}{4}} = \sqrt{\frac{9}{16} (\cos^2 \frac{t}{4} + \sin^2 \frac{t}{4})} = \sqrt{\frac{9}{16} \cdot 1} = \frac{3}{4}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Thus, the speed of the particle is \(\boxed{\frac{3}{4}}\) unit of distance per unit of time.
