[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m So, \( 3^6 \) is the highest power of 3 that divides \( 15! \). Therefore, \( 3^n \) is a factor of \( 15! \) if and only if \( n \leq 6 \).
