[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m - \( r \) is the annual interest rate (decimal), which is 10% or 0.10.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m - \( n \) is the number of times that interest is compounded per year, which is 4 (since it's compounded quarterly).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m - \( t \) is the time the money is invested for in years, which is 5.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
