[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m Next, we calculate the relative speed of the two gears:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[ \text{Relative speed} = \frac{100}{3} - 45 = \frac{100}{3} - \frac{135}{3} = \frac{100 - 135}{3} = \frac{-35}{3} \text{ times per minute} \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
