[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \mathbf{a} \mathbf{a}^T = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 7 \end{pmatrix} \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 7 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 \cdot 1 & 1 \cdot 7 \\ 7 \cdot 1 & 7 \cdot 7 \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 1 & 7 \\ 7 & 49 \end{pmatrix}
