[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m \[\left| 2z + \frac{1}{z} \right| = \left| 2re^{i\theta} + \frac{1}{r}e^{-i\theta} \right|.\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=26424)[0m 
